    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "Re \u201cTop Military Leaders Told U.S.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 1.725,
      "end_time": 4.975,
      "duration": 3.25,
      "phoneme_count": 41
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "Cities Could Be \u2018Training Grounds\u2019\u201d (front page, Oct. 1):",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 4.975,
      "end_time": 9.775,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "phoneme_count": 60
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "I was alarmed to read President Trump\u2019s remarks to military leaders at Quantico, Va., describing Americans as \u201cthe enemy within.\u201d As a veteran, and the spouse of a veteran, I know that the U.S. military\u2019s oath is to the Constitution, not to any single leader.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 45,
      "start_time": 9.775,
      "end_time": 27.95,
      "duration": 18.175,
      "phoneme_count": 273
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "Turning the language of war inward is not unity; it\u2019s division at its most dangerous.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 27.95,
      "end_time": 34.3,
      "duration": 6.35,
      "phoneme_count": 89
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "Weakening rules of engagement or reshaping loyalty toward one man risks putting service members in impossible legal and moral positions, in direct conflict with the Geneva Conventions.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 27,
      "start_time": 34.3,
      "end_time": 47.825,
      "duration": 13.525,
      "phoneme_count": 188
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "It also threatens to erode one of the last institutions that still commands broad trust: our military.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 47.825,
      "end_time": 55.25,
      "duration": 7.425,
      "phoneme_count": 107
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "Unity is not sameness.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 4,
      "start_time": 55.25,
      "end_time": 57.65,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "phoneme_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "It is respect and belonging, even for those with whom we disagree.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 12,
      "start_time": 57.65,
      "end_time": 62.575,
      "duration": 4.925,
      "phoneme_count": 66
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "Treating political opponents as \u201cenemies\u201d is how democracies crumble.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 62.575,
      "end_time": 67.875,
      "duration": 5.3,
      "phoneme_count": 70
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "We cannot afford apathy in the face of this rhetoric.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 10,
      "start_time": 67.875,
      "end_time": 71.8,
      "duration": 3.925,
      "phoneme_count": 52
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Citizens must speak out and leaders must make clear: The U.S. military serves the Constitution, and every American still belongs under its protection.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 71.8,
      "end_time": 82.675,
      "duration": 10.875,
      "phoneme_count": 159
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "Charlotte NeumannSanford, N.C.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 3,
      "start_time": 82.675,
      "end_time": 85.55,
      "duration": 2.875,
      "phoneme_count": 31
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "To the Editor:",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
