      "end_time": 87.275,
      "duration": 1.725,
      "phoneme_count": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "When are the active-duty brass going to stand up and say: \u201cSir, we\u2019re not going to do that.",
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 87.275,
      "end_time": 93.5,
      "duration": 6.225,
      "phoneme_count": 92
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "It would be unethical, illegal and just plain dangerous\u201d?",
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 93.5,
      "end_time": 97.85,
      "duration": 4.35,
      "phoneme_count": 59
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "sentence": "That\u2019s what they\u2019re sworn to do.",
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 97.85,
      "end_time": 100.325,
      "duration": 2.475,
      "phoneme_count": 29
    },
    {
